WEBVTT

00:05.380 --> 00:07.700
What is she doing?

00:13.370 --> 00:14.759
Let's chase her!

00:14.760 --> 00:16.200
Ah, okay!

00:23.800 --> 00:27.349
Good grief, how foolish.

00:27.350 --> 00:30.369
Especially for someone
who stood above others...

00:30.370 --> 00:31.220
No...

00:31.780 --> 00:34.180
This woman was merely a vanguard.

00:34.520 --> 00:35.530
A vanguard?

00:36.060 --> 00:37.310
Master Naofumi.

00:38.420 --> 00:42.150
Don't worry, this one is Makina.

00:42.510 --> 00:43.730
Makina?!

00:44.110 --> 00:47.129
I just eliminated the corrupt
that festered in the country.

00:47.130 --> 00:51.990
Well, the owner of this
body resisted, though.

00:52.560 --> 00:55.650
Shildina...? Who exactly are you?

00:56.980 --> 00:58.500
The past Heavenly Emperor?

00:58.820 --> 01:02.759
As expected of someone
who owns a spirit implement.

01:02.760 --> 01:04.210
You're quite sharp.

01:04.690 --> 01:06.459
It doesn't matter with that.

01:06.460 --> 01:07.920
Does that mean she's—

01:08.260 --> 01:09.530
What's wrong, Raph-chan?

01:11.890 --> 01:13.100
Behind her?

01:14.030 --> 01:15.489
What is that?

01:15.490 --> 01:17.680
ZWEITE AURA - BLUE EGGU SHIELD

01:18.280 --> 01:19.020
Hey!

01:23.200 --> 01:25.229
What happened all of a sudden?

01:25.230 --> 01:29.149
Even though I've taken down
the caster, she's still stubborn.

01:29.150 --> 01:35.610
I never thought you'd defy
the sigil and try to kill me.

01:36.110 --> 01:38.460
But it's just right.

01:39.630 --> 01:41.330
Something like a shadow just came out.

01:41.620 --> 01:46.430
Now, I'll be taking back
the spare body I prepared.

01:50.990 --> 01:54.430
Stop it... Lady Makina...

01:55.670 --> 01:57.699
Shildina!

01:57.700 --> 01:59.829
Is that Makina's ghost?

01:59.830 --> 02:01.430
What do you mean, give it back?!

02:01.790 --> 02:04.039
That body wasn't yours to begin with!

02:04.040 --> 02:06.520
Master Naofumi, I'll go forward.

02:07.140 --> 02:09.560
This is the attack to handle ghosts!

02:11.700 --> 02:12.610
I see!

02:13.080 --> 02:15.369
Is it behind Shildina?

02:15.370 --> 02:17.450
Yeah, no doubt.

02:27.000 --> 02:32.010
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4

02:36.300 --> 02:38.289
EPISODE 12: THE RETURN OF THE HEAVENLY EMPEROR

02:38.290 --> 02:39.429
EPISODE 12: THE RETURN OF THE HEAVENLY EMPEROR
She's gone?

02:39.430 --> 02:40.310
EPISODE 12: THE RETURN OF THE HEAVENLY EMPEROR
Watch out!

02:40.680 --> 02:41.560
Where is she?

02:46.270 --> 02:47.600
Raphtalia!

02:52.540 --> 02:53.650
Raph-chan!

02:56.920 --> 02:57.899
Are you okay?

02:57.900 --> 03:00.370
That won't do.

03:00.950 --> 03:03.010
Draw out more power
from the spirit implement...

03:03.690 --> 03:07.830
The weapon with the power to hunt souls...

03:10.000 --> 03:11.340
Draw out more!

03:11.620 --> 03:12.960
Shut up! Silence!

03:13.350 --> 03:16.360
Draw out the potential
of a soul-hunting weapon?

03:17.050 --> 03:18.590
DO YOU WANT TO USE SOUL EAT?

03:19.930 --> 03:21.930
SOUL EATER SHIELD
Soul Eat?

03:23.530 --> 03:26.140
Enough with that nonsense!

03:26.450 --> 03:28.269
Raphtalia, can you feel it?

03:28.270 --> 03:29.260
Yes!

03:29.730 --> 03:32.480
DO YOU WANT TO USE SOUL EAT?

03:37.630 --> 03:38.700
I can see her!

03:44.980 --> 03:45.920
Over there?

03:46.500 --> 03:49.169
I, Sadeena, will draw out
the power of the holy water

03:49.170 --> 03:50.729
and state my ardent wish.

03:50.730 --> 03:53.549
Dragon vein, slay my enemy before me!

03:53.550 --> 03:55.260
Saint Aqua Blast!

04:05.060 --> 04:08.510
Curse you!

04:11.280 --> 04:14.480
Just disappear!

04:15.470 --> 04:18.240
Well done.

04:21.080 --> 04:28.199
I won't forgive you! I'll make you regret
getting in my way with your very life!

04:28.200 --> 04:32.670
There's no way left for you
to survive in this world!

04:40.840 --> 04:42.550
Amazing...

04:42.980 --> 04:45.720
Finally we can finish it off.

04:46.220 --> 04:49.929
Now that this problem is resolved,

04:49.930 --> 04:52.769
I'm not sure
when I'll get to come out again.

04:52.770 --> 04:54.650
Are you still planning to do something?

04:55.010 --> 04:56.950
Holder of the spirit implement,

04:57.390 --> 05:00.360
you have the card that
Shildina gave you, right?

05:01.220 --> 05:02.640
This one?

05:03.220 --> 05:07.159
That's the crystallized piece
of Shildina's hollowed-out heart.

05:07.160 --> 05:08.639
Her heart?

05:08.640 --> 05:13.580
I can't believe she would give something
like that to someone she barely knows.

05:13.980 --> 05:16.150
I struggle to understand.

05:16.860 --> 05:22.760
No, at least she gave the important part
to the first man she truly liked.

05:24.280 --> 05:25.509
In any case...

05:25.510 --> 05:29.899
You, the Heavenly Emperor who obeys the bearer
of the spirit implement, take up your sword.

05:29.900 --> 05:30.999
Huh?

05:31.000 --> 05:35.570
If you accept my duel,
I'll free Shildina.

05:35.990 --> 05:37.070
And if we refuse?

05:37.560 --> 05:40.570
Then Shildina will die.

05:40.880 --> 05:43.119
Now you're starting to sound
a lot like Makina, huh?

05:43.120 --> 05:45.439
Say whatever you like.

05:45.440 --> 05:48.570
That's the punishment for
trusting such a poisonous woman.

05:49.050 --> 05:52.009
Master Naofumi,
please allow me to challenge her.

05:52.010 --> 05:52.789
But...

05:52.790 --> 05:54.120
Please.

05:54.550 --> 05:59.260
This is because I couldn't fully break
the curse that torments Shildina.

05:59.850 --> 06:01.010
Naofumi...

06:01.330 --> 06:02.169
Besides,

06:02.170 --> 06:05.239
if I run away now, there's no meaning
to me being a Heavenly Emperor.

06:05.240 --> 06:05.990
Right.

06:06.490 --> 06:11.520
If you're the kind of Heavenly Emperor who runs,
then I'll end you here as a pacifier.

06:11.830 --> 06:13.160
Pacifier?

06:14.510 --> 06:17.710
Well, that's enough talk for now.

06:18.160 --> 06:21.640
Will you accept or not?
That's all there is for now.

06:22.040 --> 06:22.990
Master Naofumi.

06:24.200 --> 06:25.230
Understood.

06:26.120 --> 06:28.639
If you press that against my chest,

06:28.640 --> 06:32.460
Shildina's hollow in her heart will be
filled and the binding will be released.

06:35.270 --> 06:36.380
Master Naofumi.

06:37.740 --> 06:38.820
I'm counting on you.

06:39.520 --> 06:40.160
Yes.

06:41.500 --> 06:44.519
What a strange wavelength that weapon has.

06:44.520 --> 06:46.679
A spirit implement's vassal weapon?

06:46.680 --> 06:51.100
No, the vassal weapon of a spirit implement
from a different world?

06:51.730 --> 06:55.520
Then, let our match begin.

06:58.600 --> 06:59.730
Here I come!

07:06.070 --> 07:09.899
I'm fine with a handicap,
holder of the shield spirit implement.

07:09.900 --> 07:13.540
You may cast all the support
magic you like to her.

07:13.950 --> 07:15.409
What do you mean by a handicap!

07:15.410 --> 07:16.429
Sadeena!

07:16.430 --> 07:17.400
Okay.

07:17.810 --> 07:19.630
I ask thee to read the truth once more

07:20.230 --> 07:23.550
and grant me the power to
overcome the obstacle before me!

07:23.850 --> 07:25.590
Descent of the Thunder God!

07:29.480 --> 07:30.970
Are you sure with this?

07:31.390 --> 07:33.160
It's completely fine.

07:39.560 --> 07:41.519
Sakura Stones of Destiny's barrier?!

07:41.520 --> 07:44.899
I'll use the same Sakura Stones of Destiny
to create the barrier and nullify it!

07:44.900 --> 07:46.950
That's not necessary.

07:47.550 --> 07:51.659
I've nullified it so only certain magic
can still pass through.

07:51.660 --> 07:53.599
As if we'd believe that!

07:53.600 --> 07:54.430
Raphtalia!

07:55.350 --> 07:57.249
Do as you like.

07:57.250 --> 08:03.669
Either way, the Heavenly Emperor over there
can't cancel the barrier I've deployed.

08:03.670 --> 08:04.600
What?

08:05.060 --> 08:06.919
Yeah, probably.

08:06.920 --> 08:10.890
Still, I don't like being made
to dance on someone's palm!

08:18.970 --> 08:20.400
Take this.

08:32.310 --> 08:33.389
Raphtalia!

08:33.390 --> 08:34.660
Shooting Star Shield!

08:39.050 --> 08:41.460
A battle of illusion magic?

08:41.830 --> 08:47.510
Impressive. Keeping up
with these tricky illusions.

08:48.920 --> 08:50.970
Stardust Blade!

08:52.680 --> 08:53.879
There you are!

08:53.880 --> 08:56.120
Brave Blade: Mist!

08:57.390 --> 08:58.730
I'm not finished yet.

09:06.570 --> 09:10.269
You have some resistance
and some knowledge.

09:10.270 --> 09:16.790
But you still lack knowledge
and skill in illusion technique.

09:17.560 --> 09:18.750
Hide Mirage.

09:21.310 --> 09:24.840
If this is going to be a clash of weapons,
let me have a turn too.

09:26.670 --> 09:28.590
Mighty Quake!

09:31.410 --> 09:33.090
Just how strong is she?!

09:42.110 --> 09:43.879
Powder Snow!

09:43.880 --> 09:47.060
Oh? You did well to see through that one.

09:51.460 --> 09:54.030
That's a nasty skill.

09:54.360 --> 09:58.200
Well then, I think I'm pretty warmed up now.

09:58.690 --> 10:02.250
It's about time I get serious and show you...

10:02.600 --> 10:04.520
...what the Heavenly Emperor can do.

10:06.600 --> 10:08.590
Kagura Dance of Sakura: First Formation:

10:08.930 --> 10:09.850
Blossom!

10:10.590 --> 10:11.470
Fire Defeats Metal!

10:17.560 --> 10:20.850
You temporarily disabled
your weapon, didn't you?

10:23.810 --> 10:25.349
That skill you just used.

10:25.350 --> 10:29.280
It looks like you can use a pseudo-recreation
of the Heavenly Emperor.

10:29.720 --> 10:34.519
But if you don't hone them further
and ready them for use in actual battle,

10:34.520 --> 10:36.280
then you'll find they just get repelled.

10:37.010 --> 10:39.449
Hengen Muso Style:

10:39.450 --> 10:40.450
Moon Ripple!

10:45.000 --> 10:47.070
Hengen Muso Style...

10:47.620 --> 10:51.339
I'm quite surprised you've
learned such techniques.

10:51.340 --> 10:52.719
No way...

10:52.720 --> 10:55.400
The idea is worthy of praise.

10:55.840 --> 10:58.430
Then I'll show you mine as well.

11:07.360 --> 11:09.190
Is that all you've got?

11:09.530 --> 11:12.129
What a disappointment.

11:12.130 --> 11:15.650
It seems the strong Heavenly Emperor
bloodline ends in this generation.

11:24.870 --> 11:25.620
Whoa.

11:26.190 --> 11:27.880
Five Practices Destiny Split!

11:28.240 --> 11:29.840
Five Practices Destiny Thrust!

11:33.500 --> 11:34.589
Fire Defeats Metal.

11:34.590 --> 11:36.050
Metal Quells Fire!

11:36.490 --> 11:40.689
Oh, did you sense the power
of the Heavenly Emperor by instinct?

11:40.690 --> 11:42.359
Try this then.

11:42.360 --> 11:43.810
Water Defeats Fire.

11:44.150 --> 11:44.890
Fire Quells—

11:47.840 --> 11:50.759
I can't change?
Not yet...!

11:50.760 --> 11:52.019
Tree Grows Fire!

11:52.020 --> 11:55.280
Oh? A little rough, but well done.

11:55.700 --> 11:57.910
Then I'll go all out too!

12:00.200 --> 12:02.870
This is the technique of the Heavenly Emperor!

12:03.310 --> 12:08.369
I still can't build up my strength
as quickly and powerfully as you can.

12:08.370 --> 12:11.850
That's why this is the best I can do...

12:13.480 --> 12:14.540
Here I come!

12:15.710 --> 12:17.590
Kagura Dance of Sakura: Second Formation:

12:19.390 --> 12:21.389
Yin-Yang Eight Trigrams:

12:21.390 --> 12:23.240
- Beginning Blossom!
- Split of Destiny!

12:23.720 --> 12:25.679
Five Practices Destiny Thrust!

12:25.680 --> 12:27.430
Five Practices Destiny Split!

12:35.190 --> 12:36.059
Spring Blossom Tree!

12:36.060 --> 12:38.819
Kagura Dance of Sakura: Third Formation:
Third Blossom!

12:38.820 --> 12:40.280
So beautiful.

12:40.890 --> 12:44.529
I felt like I finally understood
the meaning...

12:44.530 --> 12:49.249
...of the magical attributes Raphtalia
possesses, the light and darkness.

12:49.250 --> 12:51.460
They're not just for bending light...

12:51.750 --> 12:53.920
...or hiding within the dark.

12:54.910 --> 12:57.089
Wood Defeats Earth!
Earth Defeats Water!

12:57.090 --> 13:00.779
Water Defeats Fire! Fire Defeats Metal!
Metal Defeats Wood!

13:00.780 --> 13:04.710
Kagura Dance of Sakura: Fourth Formation:
Fifth Blossom! Sixth Blossom!

13:05.720 --> 13:09.509
Her basic nature comprised both
light and darkness, like the yin-yang,

13:09.510 --> 13:12.660
allowing her to make use of
seemingly opposing attributes.

13:13.020 --> 13:15.779
You've done well to keep up this far.

13:15.780 --> 13:21.519
Those strings of attacks are likely increasing
in attack power with each skill you unleash,

13:21.520 --> 13:25.729
but they also burn through your
strength in a short period of time.

13:25.730 --> 13:27.849
I know that pretty well.

13:27.850 --> 13:30.010
But I won't give up!

13:30.680 --> 13:33.080
Then have a taste of my own special attack.

13:35.930 --> 13:38.090
Divine Clash of the Five Practices!

13:52.940 --> 13:54.339
I can do it!

13:54.340 --> 13:58.609
I'll use the yang to oppose the controlling
power of yin and cancel them out!

13:58.610 --> 14:00.600
Now this all comes down
to a single moment.

14:01.160 --> 14:04.070
If you don't want to die, come at me!

14:05.680 --> 14:08.040
Divine Birth of the Five Practices!

14:12.480 --> 14:14.120
Hazy Moon!

14:14.460 --> 14:17.580
I just need a little more!
Just a moment more!

14:19.090 --> 14:20.460
Not yet!

14:22.180 --> 14:24.260
Vanished in an instant?

14:24.650 --> 14:26.020
Illusion Blade!

14:29.360 --> 14:32.040
This is the end.

14:33.170 --> 14:35.770
Well, that's a passing grade.

14:39.150 --> 14:44.060
You're lacking in many ways,
but you've also got real vigor.

14:45.160 --> 14:48.210
I think I can entrust the rest...

14:48.700 --> 14:49.950
...to you.

14:50.250 --> 14:50.910
What?

14:51.730 --> 14:54.779
Hold on a moment.
You weren't fighting seriously?

14:54.780 --> 14:55.870
No.

14:56.350 --> 15:01.340
I fought you with the maximum power
I could place in this body.

15:01.690 --> 15:06.599
If you can't surpass me,
you have no right to be a pacifier,

15:06.600 --> 15:11.310
especially if you are in collusion with
the holder of a spirit implement.

15:11.660 --> 15:13.000
A pacifier?

15:13.660 --> 15:16.520
Aren't they the ones
meant to stop the heroes?

15:16.790 --> 15:21.479
If you failed to display the power to
overcome me, then you would be unable

15:21.480 --> 15:23.940
to give the fools that will appear
what they deserve.

15:24.810 --> 15:31.900
I pray that you will continue the bloodline
of the Q'ten Lo Heavenly Emperor.

15:33.040 --> 15:36.299
You've caused quite a lot
of turmoil across this nation,

15:36.300 --> 15:39.250
but you showed me something
interesting here at the end.

15:40.780 --> 15:44.240
Do your best not to lose to them.

15:46.090 --> 15:50.510
Now then, the ghost from
the past will return there.

16:04.040 --> 16:05.490
Master Naofumi!

16:05.900 --> 16:07.900
We needed to care for her
as best we could.

16:08.350 --> 16:11.119
Filo! Take her to the revolutionary army!

16:11.120 --> 16:12.650
Okay!

16:13.200 --> 16:15.620
Now, next...

16:22.690 --> 16:24.429
Find the enemy Makina!

16:24.430 --> 16:26.550
Capture
the Heavenly Emperor Ruftmila as well!

16:29.000 --> 16:30.430
There!

16:30.860 --> 16:32.300
Lady Raphtalia,

16:33.000 --> 16:35.210
and the Shield Hero are here too!

16:36.520 --> 16:38.530
We won...

16:38.940 --> 16:41.330
Victory is ours!

16:48.990 --> 16:53.200
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4

16:55.490 --> 16:57.170
You finally woke up.

16:57.600 --> 17:00.169
Naofumi-chan...?

17:00.170 --> 17:01.730
How do you feel?

17:08.560 --> 17:10.519
Don't move suddenly.

17:10.520 --> 17:14.100
Right. You've been asleep
for two full days.

17:14.490 --> 17:16.020
Two whole days?

17:17.640 --> 17:19.350
What happened after that?

17:20.660 --> 17:23.239
I don't know how much you remember,

17:23.240 --> 17:27.760
but Makina was killed by the past Heavenly
Emperor you summoned with the oracle.

17:29.030 --> 17:32.420
So that's what happened... I see.

17:33.080 --> 17:36.290
Then, how about
the Heavenly Emperor Ruftmila?

17:36.900 --> 17:40.329
After Raphtalia and the past
Heavenly Emperor had a duel,

17:40.330 --> 17:42.860
he climbed up to the castle keep.

17:46.660 --> 17:50.359
He was abandoned by
Makina and his retainers,

17:50.360 --> 17:52.600
trembling alone at the back of a room.

17:53.700 --> 17:55.890
When we told him Makina was dead,

17:56.440 --> 18:00.450
he behaved like a Heavenly Emperor
and offered his life without hesitation.

18:00.840 --> 18:05.610
But that would betray the promise
Raphtalia made with you.

18:06.090 --> 18:10.210
So instead of killing him, she took upon
herself the position of Heavenly Emperor.

18:10.890 --> 18:17.250
Of course, I gave him a proper scolding
for that ridiculous decree he issued.

18:18.280 --> 18:21.259
And I spread word to the revolutionary army

18:21.260 --> 18:25.220
that the young Heavenly Emperor
had been eaten alive by a Filolial.

18:25.790 --> 18:30.260
That's a relief. But I won't be able
to see him anymore, right?

18:30.600 --> 18:32.480
That's not true.

18:38.260 --> 18:39.639
Shildina!

18:39.640 --> 18:40.829
Ruft!

18:40.830 --> 18:42.390
Ah, no... Heavenly Emperor!

18:42.840 --> 18:45.770
Shildina, I'm no longer the Heavenly Emperor.

18:46.310 --> 18:47.820
The Heavenly Emperor is this person.

18:49.590 --> 18:50.870
Thank you...

18:53.850 --> 18:55.790
Shildina...

18:56.760 --> 19:02.409
Thus, the former Heavenly Emperor Ruftmila
went into hiding in Lurolona Village.

19:02.410 --> 19:06.359
While Shildina, together with Sadeena,
settled things with their family

19:06.360 --> 19:09.450
and came to serve the new
Heavenly Emperor Raphtalia.

19:14.300 --> 19:16.840
The postwar cleanup has settled down,

19:17.170 --> 19:20.620
so let's leave the rest to them
and head back to the village quickly.

19:21.220 --> 19:25.060
You'll still have to do Heavenly Emperor
duties here from time to time, though.

19:25.550 --> 19:27.400
It's the path I chose myself.

19:27.770 --> 19:29.570
I will see it through.

19:30.590 --> 19:33.780
With your sword and the duties
of the Heavenly Emperor.

19:34.760 --> 19:35.830
I see.

19:36.250 --> 19:40.009
Master Naofumi,
what will you do with Siltvelt?

19:40.010 --> 19:41.659
Right...

19:41.660 --> 19:47.580
I should stop by on the way back to
the village and at least put on a parade.

19:48.290 --> 19:51.549
After that, the battle with the Phoenix...

19:51.550 --> 19:54.890
If we defeat the Phoenix,
there'll be the other four Guardian Spirits.

19:55.290 --> 19:58.659
Once that's done,
another Wave will come.

19:58.660 --> 20:00.759
It's going to be busy.

20:00.760 --> 20:02.230
Yeah.

20:05.890 --> 20:10.500
I wonder if my father and mother
wanted to see a sight like this.

20:11.090 --> 20:13.400
Yes, I'm sure they did.

20:22.840 --> 20:25.549
W-Wait! Spear Hero... No!

20:25.550 --> 20:27.250
Master Motoyasu!

20:27.970 --> 20:29.209
"Oink"?

20:29.210 --> 20:32.709
Oink! Oink! Oink!
(You're wrong! I did it for your sake!)

20:32.710 --> 20:35.859
I have no idea what you are saying at all.

20:35.860 --> 20:37.220
East Javelin!

20:38.180 --> 20:38.680
Oink!

20:46.870 --> 20:49.889
I managed to take down that pig
who seemed to be the faction...

20:49.890 --> 20:52.189
...that wronged my father-in-law!

20:52.190 --> 20:54.750
Now, let's move out, everyone!

20:57.000 --> 21:00.879
Ah, I forgot to annihilate her soul as well.

21:00.880 --> 21:03.620
Well, I'll have to finish her off next time.

21:33.980 --> 21:42.950
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4
